---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Imprint" description="Imprint and privacy for joseftot.com." cmd="cat imprint.txt">
  <h1>Imprint</h1>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <h2>Disclosure (§ 25 MedienG)</h2>
    <p>
      Media owner and publisher: Josef Tot, <span class="ph">[PLACEHOLDER: town]</span>, Austria.<br />
      Contact: <a href="mailto:info@joseftot.com">info@joseftot.com</a><br />
      Purpose of this site: personal blog about IT and software development, and a showcase of my own projects and music.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no tracking. Your theme choice, the command history of the prompt and your
      Space Invaders high score are stored only in your own browser (localStorage / sessionStorage) and never leave it.
      Fonts, scripts and images are served from this domain.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>SoundCloud:</strong> the <a href="/music/">music page</a> loads nothing from SoundCloud by itself. Only when
      you press play on a track is SoundCloud's player loaded for that track, and from then on SoundCloud (SoundCloud Global
      Limited &amp; Co. KG, Berlin) receives your connection data and may set cookies under its own
      <a href="https://soundcloud.com/pages/privacy">privacy policy</a>. Pressing play is your consent to that.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Hosting:</strong> the hosting provider processes technically necessary connection data (such as the IP address)
      to deliver the pages and keeps short-lived server logs for security.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      Found a vulnerability? Please write to <a href="mailto:info@joseftot.com">info@joseftot.com</a>
      (see also <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>).
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
